␀␀␀Debug server (MODE=debug)
  GET  /info            firmware, memory, tasks, OTA state
  GET  /log             log ring (live: nc <host> 2323)
  POST /ota             firmware image (.pio/build/esp32s3/firmware.bin)
  POST /reboot
  GET  /coredump        last crash's core dump (ELF)
  POST /coredump/erase
  GET  /symbols[?sha=<elf sha256 prefix>]  function names of a build in flash
  POST /panic           crash on purpose (to try the core dump tools)
  POST /loglevel?tag=<tag|*>&level=<none|error|warn|info>
